      "message": "(actually I don\u0027t know why the original issue report suggests adding `block_index + count \u003e sizeof(block_buffer)`, it\u0027s always good to add the explicit check but it won\u0027t happen)\n\nSince we guaranteed that the initial `block_size \u003c\u003d sizeof(block_buffer)` at line 600, and `block_index + block_size` never exceeds that initial value, `block_index + count \u003c\u003d sizeof(block_buffer)` is already guaranteed by `count \u003c\u003d block_size` on the left half of line 619.\"",
